# Default owner: the test automation team. It owns the generator engine, the shared tooling, the
# camunda-oca config, AND the hub report/triage tooling — the weekly coverage report, the nightly triage
# agent, the coverage-fix agent, issue-filing, Slack notifications, digests and janitors, and their docs
# and agent playbooks. Changes to that machinery (its formatting, plumbing, routing) are test automation's
# to review, not the Hub team's.
*  @camunda/test-automation-team

# Hub-facing surface — the Hub team co-owns only two things:
#   1. What gets tested for camunda-hub: the camunda-hub config (and the spec-bump that keeps the tested
#      spec current).
#   2. What BUILDS, STARTS or RUNS the suite against Hub: the suite-run / nightly / PR-check / on-demand
#      workflows, the Hub runtime (docker), and the clone / token / wait / run-summary plumbing.
# Everything the automation does with the RESULTS (report, triage, file issues, notify, digest, clean up)
# stays on the `*` default above. CODEOWNERS is last-match-wins, so the rules below override `*`.

# 1. What gets tested.
/configs/camunda-hub/                               @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/workflows/spec-bump-check.yml              @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/scripts/spec-bump-open-pr.sh               @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team

# 2. Building / starting / running the suite against Hub. (slack-token and fail-if-slack-failed are NOT
# here: they serve the OCA leg of spec-bump-check too, so they stay shared on the default.)
/.github/actions/clone-hub-sibling/                 @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/actions/hub-clone-token/                   @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/actions/wait-for-hub/                      @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/actions/hub-run-summary/                   @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/scripts/e2e/run-hub.sh                             @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/docker/start-hub.sh                                @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/docker/docker-compose.hub.yml                      @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/workflows/_hub-suite-run.yml               @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/workflows/nightly-camunda-hub.yml          @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/workflows/hub-pr-check.yml                 @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/workflows/hub-pr-live-check.yml            @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
/.github/workflows/hub-ondemand-test.yml            @camunda/hub @camunda/test-automation-team
